 "description": "\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tCompanions\n\t\n\nSomeone measured a real thing and published what they found. A companion sits beside their data.\nWhat does a model built from your published data say about the runs it never saw?\nEach config here is a companion to one open dataset or report. It names the people who made the measurements and links to their work. Then it holds, run by run, what a model built from part of that work predicts for the runs that were held back from it, and every prediction comes with its… See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/spiderpilot89/zero-trust-physics-companions.",
